&gt=3B&nbsp=3B &nbsp=3B - No news of the situation having changed<br>=0A=
&gt=3B&nbsp=3B &nbsp=3B - If there is no news on the situation after DebCon=
f16=2C I will<br>=0A=
&gt=3B&nbsp=3B &nbsp=3B &nbsp=3B assume kfreebsd-* will not target Stretch.=
<br>=0A=
<br>=0A=
</span>Who has been keeping it up for stretch? (As a side note Stephen<br>=
=0A=
Chamberlain=2C Christoph Egger and many other people keep working on it)<br=
>=0A=
Not sure if those arches have more or less manpower than powerpc (in<br>=0A=
example). I think it would be great to make a call here=2C we either<br>=0A=
move kfreebsd ports to debian-ports infrastructure or go for the<br>=0A=
release with it.<br>=0A=
<br>=0A=
