must be decomissioned ASAP=2C leaving the port in a situation of not<br>=0A=
geographic redundancy. However advanced plans exists to deploy mips<br>=0A=
hardware in other data centers RSN."<br>=0A=
<br>=0A=
I'll keep you posted whenever there is progress on that area. I do not<br>=
